      "title": "READ ME: how to use",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "SCRIPT → 60-70 PHOTOREAL IMAGES (Runware only)\n\nFIRST TIME ONLY\n1. If a 'missing nodes' box appears, click Install (Runware),\n   then restart ComfyUI and drag this file in again.\n2. Settings (gear, bottom left) → search 'Runware' →\n   paste your key in 'Runware API key'.\n\nEVERY VIDEO\n1. Paste your script in the green 'PASTE SCRIPT HERE' box.\n2. Type how many images you want in 'NUMBER OF IMAGES' (e.g. 65).\n3. Set 'SCENE NUMBER' to 1.\n4. Next to the Run button, set the count to the SAME number (e.g. 65).\n5. Press Run. Claude plans all scenes once, then one image is\n   made per scene: scene_001, scene_002, ...\n\nImages: ComfyUI/output/script_video/\nAll scenes and prompts: see the 'ALL SCENES' box.\nRedo one image: set SCENE NUMBER to it, Run count 1, press Run.\n\nModels: Claude Fable 5 (planning + prompts), FLUX.2 [max] (images)."
      ],
      "widgets_values_named": {
        "text": "SCRIPT → 60-70 PHOTOREAL IMAGES (Runware only)\n\nFIRST TIME ONLY\n1. If a 'missing nodes' box appears, click Install (Runware),\n   then restart ComfyUI and drag this file in again.\n2. Settings (gear, bottom left) → search 'Runware' →\n   paste your key in 'Runware API key'.\n\nEVERY VIDEO\n1. Paste your script in the green 'PASTE SCRIPT HERE' box.\n2. Type how many images you want in 'NUMBER OF IMAGES' (e.g. 65).\n3. Set 'SCENE NUMBER' to 1.\n4. Next to the Run button, set the count to the SAME number (e.g. 65).\n5. Press Run. Claude plans all scenes once, then one image is\n   made per scene: scene_001, scene_002, ...\n\nImages: ComfyUI/output/script_video/\nAll scenes and prompts: see the 'ALL SCENES' box.\nRedo one image: set SCENE NUMBER to it, Run count 1, press Run.\n\nModels: Claude Fable 5 (planning + prompts), FLUX.2 [max] (images)."
